1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:05,342
One number in your 2027 budget is one guess.

2
00:00:05,462 --> 00:00:11,981
Our founder, Muhammad Imran, has 20+ years in finance and business management.

3
00:00:12,101 --> 00:00:14,667
Here's a habit worth building.

4
00:00:14,787 --> 00:00:21,013
One sales figure, one outcome, and no plan B.

5
00:00:21,133 --> 00:00:23,714
Build three cases instead.

6
00:00:23,834 --> 00:00:28,925
Low, base and high. Same fixed costs, three sales outcomes.

7
00:00:29,045 --> 00:00:33,401
Then check your cash and covenants hold in the low case.

8
00:00:33,521 --> 00:00:38,639
Scenario budgets are part of our fractional CFO work.

9
00:00:38,759 --> 00:00:43,857
Building your 2027 budget? Send us a WhatsApp.
